---
const IMG = 'https://zapp-v2.vercel.app/illustrations';
const PUMP = 'https://pump.fun/coin/Ab16ce5SDbibTbXevxHLpqUnUvu9tNkkpaJcSDvCpump';
---
<div id="dim-future" class="page">
  <div class="f-grad"></div>
  <canvas id="future-canvas"></canvas>
  <div class="f-split">
    <div>
      <div class="f-tag rv">9 · Future · The Network</div>
      <h1 class="f-h1 rv d1">Free energy<br>for <em>everyone</em>.</h1>
      <p class="f-lead rv d2">No banks. No borders. Zapped to anyone on Earth instantly. The answer Tesla never got to give.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="geo rv d1">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 460 460" fill="none">
        <defs><linearGradient id="ga" x1="0" y1="0" x2="460" y2="460"><stop stop-color="#7C3AED"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#06B6D4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#10B981"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="gb" x1="460" y1="0" x2="0" y2="460"><stop stop-color="#EC4899"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#7C3AED"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#06B6D4"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="gc" x1="0" y1="460" x2="460" y2="0"><stop stop-color="#10B981"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#F59E0B"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#EC4899"/></linearGradient></defs>
        <g class="gR1"><circle cx="230" cy="230" r="212" stroke="url(#ga)" stroke-width=".7" stroke-dasharray="6 14" opacity=".45"/><circle cx="442" cy="230" r="4" fill="url(#ga)"/><circle cx="18" cy="230" r="4" fill="url(#gb)"/></g>
        <g class="gR2"><circle cx="230" cy="230" r="168" stroke="url(#gb)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-dasharray="3 10" opacity=".4"/><polygon points="230,62 402,158 402,302 230,398 58,302 58,158" stroke="url(#ga)" stroke-width=".5" fill="none" opacity=".28"/></g>
        <g class="gR3"><circle cx="230" cy="230" r="118" stroke="url(#gc)" stroke-width=".7" stroke-dasharray="2 7" opacity=".42"/></g>
        <g class="gR4"><circle cx="230" cy="230" r="72" stroke="url(#ga)" stroke-width=".6" opacity=".38"/></g>
        <circle cx="230" cy="230" r="30" stroke="url(#gb)" stroke-width=".7" opacity=".45"/>
        <circle cx="230" cy="230" r="10" fill="url(#ga)" opacity=".8"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="f-scenes">
    <div class="f-row rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/future-world-v2.jpg`} alt="" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#EDE9FE'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">The Infrastructure</p><h3 class="f-h3">The network<br>already <em>exists</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">65,000+ TPS. $0.00025 fee. Sub-second finality. Tesla's dream — running on Solana right now.</p></div></div>
    <div class="f-row flip rv"><div class="f-img"><img src={`${IMG}/torch-v2.jpg`} alt="" onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='#EDE9FE'"></div><div><p class="f-kicker">The Signal Lives</p><h3 class="f-h3">They silenced the tower.<br>Not the <em>frequency</em>.</h3><p class="f-p">Owned by no one. Available to everyone. The frequency Wardenclyffe was built to transmit — now permanent on the blockchain.</p><div class="rm-list"><div class="rm-i rv"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Instant ⚡ZAPP payments at live events worldwide</p></div><div class="rm-i rv d1"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Humanitarian partnerships and NGO integrations</p></div><div class="rm-i rv d2"><div class="rm-d"></div><p>Micro-grants — no bank, no middleman, no border</p></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="f-close rv"><span class="freq">3 · 6 · 9 ∞</span><h2>⚡ZAPP is the answer<br>Tesla never got to <em>give</em>.</h2><p>Decentralised. Borderless. Free for everyone. Forever.</p><button class="btn-future" data-hub style="cursor:pointer;margin-right:1rem">↩ Hub</button><a href={PUMP} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-future">Buy ⚡ZAPP</a></div>
</div>
